	(text "1 GND, 2 TX (Pi GPIO 14 out), 3 RX (GPIO 15 in).\nMatches common USB-UART leads (their RX to pin 2).\n3.3 V levels only: never a 5 V adapter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320.04 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
